   "text": "WEB APP  (next build \u2192 server)\n\u2022 /api/news: HN, dev.to, RSS, cached 5 min\n\u2022 /api/article: reader mode on the server\n  (linkedom + Readability + sanitize-html)\n\u2022 Spotify Web Playback SDK (plays in browser)",
   "originalText": "WEB APP  (next build \u2192 server)\n\u2022 /api/news: HN, dev.to, RSS, cached 5 min\n\u2022 /api/article: reader mode on the server\n  (linkedom + Readability + sanitize-html)\n\u2022 Spotify Web Playback SDK (plays in browser)",
