   "text": "ANDROID APP  (STACK_TARGET=apk \u2192 static out/ \u2192 Capacitor 8)\n\u2022 No server: fetches news + pages on the phone\n  (CapacitorHttp, DOMParser + DOMPurify)\n\u2022 Native Java plugins (see right) + animated splash\n\u2022 Phone portrait \u00b7 tablet rail + rotation",
   "originalText": "ANDROID APP  (STACK_TARGET=apk \u2192 static out/ \u2192 Capacitor 8)\n\u2022 No server: fetches news + pages on the phone\n  (CapacitorHttp, DOMParser + DOMPurify)\n\u2022 Native Java plugins (see right) + animated splash\n\u2022 Phone portrait \u00b7 tablet rail + rotation",
