   "text": "PHASE 1 \u00b7 Finish & stabilise  (week 1)\n\u2022 Spotify inside Stack (App Remote SDK): no more 'no active device'  [code parked in\n   native/wip]\n\u2022 Release-signed APK + version numbers; simple in-app 'update available' check\n\u2022 Offline cache: today's cards + saved articles readable with no network\n\u2022 Deploy the web app (Vercel) so there is a shareable link",
   "originalText": "PHASE 1 \u00b7 Finish & stabilise  (week 1)\n\u2022 Spotify inside Stack (App Remote SDK): no more 'no active device'  [code parked in\n   native/wip]\n\u2022 Release-signed APK + version numbers; simple in-app 'update available' check\n\u2022 Offline cache: today's cards + saved articles readable with no network\n\u2022 Deploy the web app (Vercel) so there is a shareable link",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
