   "text": "PHASE 2 \u00b7 Stack's unique features  (weeks 2\u20133)\n\u2022 Focus session: pick a PDF/article \u2192 25-min timer + music + notes, summary at the end\n\u2022 Share to Stack: send any link from Chrome/YouTube/WhatsApp to your Library (read\n   later)\n\u2022 Listen mode: articles & PDFs read aloud (Android TextToSpeech) in the media\n   notification",
   "originalText": "PHASE 2 \u00b7 Stack's unique features  (weeks 2\u20133)\n\u2022 Focus session: pick a PDF/article \u2192 25-min timer + music + notes, summary at the end\n\u2022 Share to Stack: send any link from Chrome/YouTube/WhatsApp to your Library (read\n   later)\n\u2022 Listen mode: articles & PDFs read aloud (Android TextToSpeech) in the media\n   notification",
